        "value": "外に歩兵四人、尤も過に備へ置き候（ほかに ほへい よにん、もっとも かに そなへおきそうろう）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "A further note in two registers: in addition, four infantrymen, held in reserve against contingency. The right sub-column holds 外ニ (two glyphs); the left holds the ten glyphs 步兵四人尤過ニ備置候, whose 尤 and 過 I read at 5x. These four men stand outside the eight platoons."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "宇都宮外ニ步兵"
